---
title: "C07 — Ancestor permission decision · Implemented"
---
flowchart TD
  Request[Requested container] --> Exists{Valid live hierarchy in active tenant?}
  Exists -->|No| Missing[404]
  Exists -->|Yes| Member{Current membership valid?}
  Member -->|No| Denied[403 or authentication failure]
  Member -->|Yes| Admin{Workspace admin?}
  Admin -->|Yes| Action[Apply operation policy]
  Admin -->|No| Ancestors[Walk target and all ancestors]
  Ancestors --> Deny{Any explicit deny?}
  Deny -->|Yes| Hidden[Direct access 403; tree prunes subtree]
  Deny -->|No| Private{Every private ancestor has its own allow?}
  Private -->|No| Hidden
  Private -->|Yes| Action
  Action --> Role{Role may perform this action?}
  Role -->|Yes| Allowed[Continue]
  Role -->|No| Denied
